      "role": "user",
      "content": "That’s a bold claim—that the procurement logs will just \"clear automatically\" without any manual intervention or new shipments arriving. \n\nCould you explain the logic behind that? I need to be able to justify that specific part of the assessment if the board asks why we're ignoring active alerts in the Tier 2 logs. What exactly is happening in the background modules to ensure those alerts resolve themselves?",
